@startuml
title Tra cứu hóa đơn
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Customer
actor Employee
boundary CustomerApp
boundary AdminPortal
control API
control InvoiceService
entity PostgreSQL

Customer->CustomerApp: Xem hóa đơn của đơn hàng
CustomerApp->API: GET /orders/:orderId/invoice
API->InvoiceService: Verify customer owns order
InvoiceService->PostgreSQL: Query invoice by order and customer
PostgreSQL-->InvoiceService: Invoice summary or none
InvoiceService-->API: Invoice summary
API-->CustomerApp: 200 invoice or 404
Employee->AdminPortal: Xem hóa đơn quản trị
AdminPortal->API: GET /admin/orders/:orderId/invoice
API->InvoiceService: Verify active employee JWT
InvoiceService->PostgreSQL: Query invoice by order
PostgreSQL-->InvoiceService: Invoice summary or none
InvoiceService-->API: Invoice summary
API-->AdminPortal: 200 invoice or 404
@enduml
